### ⚠️ Critical Notes & Caveats

1.  **Greedy Purity Warning (Block 10 & 13):**
    *   **Block 10:** Changes decode numerics on K-split paths due to FP32 reduction reordering. Outputs are deterministic *within* a build but1.38.812.984 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =   1497, tg =  25.66 t/s, tg_3s =  27.36 t/s
 may differ from stock builds.
