    *   Must use `git am` or `scripts/apply1.41.833.451 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =   1586, tg =  25.85 t/s, tg_3s =  29.47 t/s
-all.sh`.
    *   `git apply` on concatenated patches will silently drop hunks and break the build.

