    *   Block 12 (All-Reduce) is **RDNA4-only**.
    *   Block 15 memory optimizations are most effective on RD1.44.119.264 I sched_graph_realloc: graph reallocation: nodes = 5217 (changed = 0), splits = 50, n_same = 13, n_diff = 0
NA4 but apply generally.

